{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTRO AMIGO</strong> is a story-driven sci-fi adventure game where you explore a strange Wisconsin town, investigate its secrets, play mini-games, and make story-shaping choices as new kid Austin searches for his missing dog, Amigo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MYSTERY  SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a heartfelt coming-of-age story full of mystery, humor, and small-town strangeness. Explore Sidgrove, meet its oddball residents, and uncover the truth behind Amigo\u2019s disappearance as something otherworldly  stirs beneath the surface. Your choices  guide the story and determine one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTUROUS MINI-GAMES AND PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a narrative adventure. It\u2019s a blast of  gameplay and quirky mini-games full of charm: epic chases, paranormal sightings, school gym dodgeball, cryptic puzzles, catch with Amigo, and  more!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, supernatural story shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi adventure gameplay full of  charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with quirky mini-games and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art paired with an  original synth soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with love by a  two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming summer 2026.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577850?t=1765167579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/6c522c530c502930b1a9b56273ca23e2eb34f54f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765167579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.stea